    "es": "Además, no creáis que la gente llama al comité Nobel para verificar las cosas.",
    "en": "Also, it's not like anyone actually calls up the Nobel committee to double-check things.",
    "noteEn": "The Spanish archive and official xkcd source both identify comic #699. Their title texts are preserved exactly. The Spanish raster says TRAS EL SEGUNDO TRIMESTRE where the official English raster says ‘until the second trimester’; the authored transcript follows the visible Spanish source. OCR omitted accents in BEBÉ, TODAVÍA, and the one-word QUÉ question, read UNO as LINO, and split GRAVEDAD across its printed line wrap."
